From ace03ae7a4854b6eca858e64f529c006efcbfff4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MiaAI-Lab <noreply@localhost>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 01:38:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] glm: unified S1 candidates behind policy bits 16-19 and
 TF_GLM_UNI_EY_BF16

Bit 16 (U1): TF_GLM_L2PF's second table (proj_dec / q_b, shared expert, head, site q)
with a stopping paced kernel. Bit 17 (U2): DFlash2 gathers and greedyRows over the RoCE
mesh. Bit 18 (U3a): P2 decode forms of glm_mm8. Bit 19 (U3b): down_combine without the
dead fp32 slot rows. TF_GLM_UNI_EY_BF16=1 (U3e): bf16-sized prompt slot rows.
